# ralph-loop / harden-loop runtime artifacts (regenerated each run)
docs/plans/*/ralph-codex-*.log
docs/plans/*/agent-reports.log
docs/plans/*/overseer.log

# converge-loop runtime artifacts (one level deeper than ralph/harden because
# plan dirs live under docs/plans/converge/<slug>/). The static records that
# survive a run — goal.md, convergence.md, prompt.md, goal.history.log — stay
# tracked; the per-round event streams and overseer/agent appendix logs get
# regenerated each run and are pure noise in `git status`.
docs/plans/converge/*/converge-*-iteration-*.log
docs/plans/converge/*/agent-reports.log
docs/plans/converge/*/overseer.log
